<title>USA: PennCorp stockholder merger vote March 21.</title>
<headline>PennCorp stockholder merger vote March 21.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PennCorp Financial Group Inc said on Thursday it set March 21 for a special stockholders meeting to vote on its proposed merger with Washington National Corp.</p>
<p>Stockholders also will vote on PennCorp's proposed increase in the number of authorized common shares to 100 million, from 50 million.</p>
<p>They also will vote on PennCorp's proposed purchase of the Fickes and Stone Knightsbridge interests, and of all the Southwestern Financial Corp stock not already owned by PennCorp.</p>
